That operation center gets the...

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:39.160
word new line station delta mike reports four unknowns bearing three six zero degrees 49 000

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:47.340
feet tracking two zero zero degrees ground speed 500 at norad the threat is analyzed military

